# OntoSage capability vocabulary — SUPERSEDED.
#
# The canonical, publication-ready OntoSage Conversational Building Vocabulary (OCBV) now lives in
#   input/ontosage_schema.ttl
# (a single, fully-documented, Brick-extending schema). This stub is kept only so existing
# tooling that globs ontology/*.ttl finds a valid file; it intentionally declares no terms to
# avoid duplicating the schema. Per-building instances (input/<bldg>_capabilities.ttl,
# input/<bldg>_knowledge.ttl) are dual-typed and resolve against OCBV.

@prefix ontosage: <http://ontosage.org/capabilities#> .
@prefix rdfs:     <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://ontosage.org/ontology> rdfs:seeAlso ontosage:Capability .
